{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34369","headline":"正月十五惜春寄袭美 · 陆龟蒙","name":"正月十五惜春寄袭美","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六分春色一分休，满眼东波尽是愁。\n花匠凝寒应束手，酒龙多病尚垂头。\n无穷嬾惰齐中散，有底机谋敌右侯。\n见织短篷裁小檝，拿烟闲弄个渔舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34369.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34369","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}